 r←Test_AskNumber_003(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;value;⎕TRAP;okFlag
⍝ Exercise the "Create" method with some props. "Cancel" is pressed automatically via "autoPress".
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 myGuiParms.caption←0⊃⎕XSI
 myGuiParms.icon←'File:///',GetFile'Sample.ico'

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Number of copies:'
 parms.value←3
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.autoPress←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.Buttons.Cancel

 (okFlag value)←myGuiParms parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.AskForNumber''
 →T.FailsIf 0≠okFlag
 →T.FailsIf value≡3

 r←T._OK
